{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hNFKdB1RTb1795045418.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>商湯首三季度收入，按年增長三成。</p><p></p><p>增速較2026年上半年進一步加快，主要由生成式AI板塊驅動，其業務收入增速持續高於集團整體收入增速，其中第三季度按年增長超過一倍。首三季度毛利率按年提升4.3個百分點，至百分之43.4。毛利增加四成半，至16.47億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.871056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:14.079177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:18.135415+00:00","content_hash":"d5335e5eea013f3240fa9e8823d5ad350e97bcd7b58c3aadca668f2ed708dc28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.871056+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}